{"unit_id":"zenVibeCoding__dsh-ai-gateway-provider#feature-1","repo":"zenVibeCoding/dsh-ai-gateway-provider","commit":"b611369c4badfb2dba8d4972a71ada4efb47959c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"AI Gateway for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「多网关接入」：在设置页保存多个兼容网关；每个网关在模型选择器中独立分组。可先测试连接再保存。 通过网关设置页或模型管理操作触发，结果用于配置和检查模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:451-508"]}
{"unit_id":"zenVibeCoding__dsh-ai-gateway-provider#feature-2","repo":"zenVibeCoding/dsh-ai-gateway-provider","commit":"b611369c4badfb2dba8d4972a71ada4efb47959c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"AI Gateway for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「模型目录与参数管理」：读取网关模型目录，并可发现、隐藏模型或编辑协议、上下文、输出上限和推理能力等覆盖项。 通过网关设置页或模型管理操作触发，结果用于配置和检查模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:378-427"]}
{"unit_id":"zenVibeCoding__dsh-ai-gateway-provider#feature-3","repo":"zenVibeCoding/dsh-ai-gateway-provider","commit":"b611369c4badfb2dba8d4972a71ada4efb47959c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"AI Gateway for DeepSeek Harness 的功能「模型连通性测试」：用户可对单个模型或一批模型发起小型请求测试，查看协议、耗时、响应预览及分类后的错误结果。 通过网关设置页或模型管理操作触发，结果用于配置和检查模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:378-405"]}
